ya evaṃ veda, yo''pāmāyatanaṃ veda, āyatanavān bhavati ॥
jātī caṃpaka punnāga mallikā vakulādibhiḥ ।
puṣpāṃjaliṃ pradāsyāmi gṛhāṇa dviradānana ॥
gaṇādhipa namaste''stu umāputrāghanāśana ।
vināyakeśatanaya sarvasiddhipradāyaka ॥
ekadaṃtaikavadana tathā mūṣakavāhana ।
kumāragurave tubhyamarpayāmi sumāṃjalim ॥
oṃ śrī siddhivināyaka svāmine namaḥ maṃtrapuṣpaṃ samarpayāmi ।' || chr(10) || mantra_translit,
  source_ref = 'Sampradaya Vratha Pooja Vidhi (Giri), p.78, mantrapuSHpam. The step previously opened with a Ganesha namaskara shloka under the heading "Mantra Pushpam"; the actual mantra pushpam, the Taittirīya Āraṇyaka passage "yo''pāṃ puṣpaṃ veda", was absent from both poojas. The previous verses are kept -- they are a genuine pushpāñjali and the book places one in the same position -- with the Vedic passage before them, as the book has it. Transcribed from a photograph of the printed page, so unlike the rest of this project it carries no round-trip proof; diffed line by line against the previous text before it was written.',
